# Frontend styling (`apps/web`)

- **Tailwind v4 utilities in JSX** are the standard for all UI. Design tokens live in `apps/web/tailwind.config.ts` (`void`, `ink`, `ember`, `mint`, `muted`, `line`, plus dashboard semantics).
- **`globals.css`** is tokens and resets only: `@import "tailwindcss"`, `@config`, fonts, base-layer `html`/`body`/`a`/`code`. No bespoke component classes (`.landing-*`, `.panel`, `.btn`, etc.).
- Repeated long dashboard class strings may use `src/lib/uiClasses.ts`. Do not add new named classes to `globals.css` — use arbitrary values in JSX instead.
- Dot-matrix / ASCII components (`AsciiPoolField`): logic in TS; outer layout only via Tailwind.

Full convention: `.claude/skills/zealed-fhevm/SKILL.md` Section 7.
